# Whitelist: only the built site, its video files and the deploy workflow are published.
# build.js, generate.js, site.config.js, _src, content, _source, the reports and the raw
# client photographs and clips stay local (the site-security gate flags them as S1 if they
# are served or public).
*
!.gitignore
!.github/
!.github/**
!index.html
!media/
!media/*.mp4
!_site/
!_site/**
